msgid "New boxes only: choose a native Free or Pro template from field discovery."
msgstr "Kotak baru saja: pilih template Free atau Pro asli dari penemuan field."

#: src/core/Mcp/Objects.php:43
msgid ""
"List a bounded page of native objects with IDs, titles, slugs and status. "
"Only editable objects are returned. Read the exact object and its field "
"schema before editing. Follow total_pages even if permissions filter a page "
"to empty."
msgstr ""
"Daftar halaman objek asli yang dibatasi dengan ID, judul, slug, dan status. "
"Hanya objek yang dapat diedit yang dikembalikan. Baca objek yang tepat dan "
"skema field-nya sebelum mengedit. Ikuti total_pages meskipun izin menyaring "
"halaman menjadi kosong."

#: src/core/Mcp/Objects.php:52
msgid ""
"Read a verified native object with its editable settings and revision hash. "
"Does not expose arbitrary post metadata. Custom field definitions are "
"distinct from author profile values."
msgstr ""
"Baca objek asli yang terverifikasi dengan pengaturan yang dapat diedit dan "
"hash revisi. Tidak mengekspos metadata pos sembarang. Definisi field kustom "
"berbeda dari nilai profil penulis."

#: src/core/Mcp/Objects.php:61
msgid ""
"Discover native editor labels, field types, supported choices and "
"edition-specific fields. Optional id selects an existing object. Unknown or "
"inactive-edition fields are rejected during saves."
msgstr ""
"Temukan label editor asli, jenis field, pilihan yang didukung, dan field "
"spesifik edisi. ID opsional memilih objek yang ada. Field yang tidak "
"dikenal atau tidak aktif ditolak saat menyimpan."

#: src/core/Mcp/Objects.php:73
msgid ""
"Create a native object or patch a verified ID using discovered typed "
"fields. New objects need a title and default to draft. Updates require "
"expected_hash, preserve omitted fields and use native sanitizers. dry_run "
"validates without saving. menu_order controls native list ordering. "
"Managing custom field definitions requires Pro."
msgstr ""
"Buat objek asli atau patch ID yang terverifikasi menggunakan field bertipe "
"yang ditemukan. Objek baru memerlukan judul dan default ke draf. Pembaruan "
"memerlukan expected_hash, menjaga field yang diabaikan dan menggunakan "
"pembersih asli. dry_run memvalidasi tanpa menyimpan. menu_order mengontrol "
"urutan daftar asli. Mengelola definisi field kustom memerlukan Pro."

#: src/core/Mcp/Objects.php:88
msgid ""
"Trash a verified native object with delete_post permission and "
"expected_hash. Does not permanently delete it when Trash is disabled. "
"Existing references are not rewritten. dry_run checks without deleting; "
"custom field deletion requires Pro."
msgstr ""
"Buang objek asli yang terverifikasi dengan izin delete_post dan "
"expected_hash. Tidak menghapusnya secara permanen saat Trash dinonaktifkan. "
"Referensi yang ada tidak ditulis ulang. dry_run memeriksa tanpa menghapus; "
"penghapusan field kustom memerlukan Pro."

